{"results":[{"url":"https://www.facebook.com/santanderuk/posts/please-stay-safe-online-beware-of-fake-accountsa-facebook-account-called-santand/852454194845186/","final_url":"https://www.facebook.com/santanderuk/posts/please-stay-safe-online-beware-of-fake-accountsa-facebook-account-called-santand/852454194845186/","title":"Santander UK","description":"Please stay safe online – beware of fake accounts\n\nA Facebook account called “Santander Bank” has been contacting people claiming that they have won a Santander competition. Please note: Santander...","language":"en","text":"Please stay safe online – beware of fake accounts\n\nA Facebook account called “Santander Bank” has been contacting people claiming that they have won a Santander competition. Please note: Santander Bank is not connected to Santander UK in any way.\n\nIf you are contacted by Santander Bank please do not respond. Please do report any contact directly to Facebook here: https://www.facebook.com/help/181495968648557/. This will help our efforts to have this account closed down.\n\nSantander UK and Santander Students are the only genuine Santander UK Facebook accounts. We will NEVER send you a friend request or ask you for your account details.\n\nIf you have any questions please ask us below.\n\nAll reactions:\n\n17 comments\n\n321 shares\n\nLike\n\nComment\n\nMost relevant\n\n\n\nCaldwell Ssharon\n\nSantander bank are also sending emails asking to verify online details got one today.\n\n1\n\nSantander UK replied\n\n1 Reply\n\nAuthor\n\nThanks for pointing that out Piers. I can confirm the page is genuine. We'll work to getting this corrected as soon as possible. Dave.\n\n1\n\nMike Stevenson\n\nHow do we know this one isn't fake and the other one isn't the real one?\n\nSantander UK replied\n\n4 Replies\n\nPaul Rumbelow\n\nWell done Santander for warning people\n\n4\n\nPiers Christian\n\nSantander Students doesn't seem to have the blue tick mentioned in your reply to Mike...\n\nAlec Paterson\n\nNo blue tick on my iPad\n\nMelanie Colley\n\nMartin Colley for info x\n\nHannah Oakes\n\nLyndis Tyrrel just to be safe!\n\nMost relevant is selected, so some comments may have been filtered out.","author":null,"published_date":null,"latency_ms":5013.50202499998,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}